WEBVTT

00:03:01.876 --> 00:03:05.036
A handful of companies
cannot take on that challenge alone.

00:03:06.236 --> 00:03:08.196
But we can do more than most.

00:03:09.996 --> 00:03:11.956
So let me offer you one framework

00:03:11.996 --> 00:03:15.556
of what I believe we can do

00:03:15.596 --> 00:03:17.116
and why it matters.

00:03:17.916 --> 00:03:22.236
I call that the 1/4/20 challenge.

00:03:23.596 --> 00:03:25.436
That is, one gigaton,

00:03:25.436 --> 00:03:29.036
four gigatons
and 20 gigatons of CO2.